Come on.

38
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,840
Why are you acting so cold?

39
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,440
That day,

40
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,840
you were the one
who made the first move.

41
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,240
Inspector.

42
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,680
What are you thinking?

43
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,640
I'm leaving.

44
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,640
I'll leave the evidence to you.

45
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,400
I trust you.

46
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,040
Tangme.

47
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,640
Tangme, they're fighting again.

48
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,680
I have no idea why.

49
