I told you. I am a doctor.

53
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,000
Then why did you save me?

54
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,920
Why didn't you chase him?

55
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,640
Because you just saved me.

56
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,880
What do I have to do

57
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,880
