58
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,080
Inspector?

59
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,480
Mm.

60
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,960
Inspector.

61
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:17,280
This is all the evidence
I compiled from the case files.

62
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:21,440
I think Tee is most likely the killer,

63
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,560
the one who murdered Mint.

64
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:27,200
As for the DNA collected
from Tee's gunshot wound,

65
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,040
