accepted me as your partner.

80
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,440
I've always kept that boundary clear.

81
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,160
You saw it yourself.

82
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,120
That line is practically broken.

83
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:37,400
Why are you still so hung up on it?

84
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,880
I think...

85
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:46,000
