I'll cross the line and get closer.

86
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:50,640
You're afraid you'll be the one
to cross it and get close to me first.

87
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:57,160
Just like you were the one
who kissed me that day.

88
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,560
Uh...

89
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:16,120
Here's some additional info on Tee.

90
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,000
Hello?

91
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,640
Can any of you reach Tee?

92
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,680
Hey, bro.

93
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:29,040
We can't reach Tee at all right now.

94
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,560
Who are you talking to?

95
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:32,800
Inspector James.

96
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,600
Put him on speaker.

97
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,200
Let me talk too.

98
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,120
Why are you so nosy?

99
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,040
Hello?

100
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:43,920
Do you know anyone else
who knows Tee or is close to him?

101
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,000
Anyone else he's close to?

102
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,360
Besides us...

103
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,560
Oh, right.

104
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,000
His partner.

105
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,320
His partner studies medicine
at another university.

106
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,960
And I think he'll start interning

107
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:59,160
