108
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,160
Okay, thank you.

109
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,760
All right. Bye.

110
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,600
Okay.

111
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:08,000
