119
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,400
Uh...

120
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,400
I'm fine.

121
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,360
By the way,

122
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,400
