126
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,480
Do you need me

127
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,600
to submit all the reports to the police?

128
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,240
Not yet.

129
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:48,000
Wait until I catch Tee.

130
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,960
If you discover anything else,

131
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,480
