132
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,280
Okay.

133
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,480
Take your medicine.

134
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,400
Hey, Chita, have you

135
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:00,520
