136
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,680
I need to send them for testing.

137
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,240
They're ready.

138
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:05,760
Do you want to come take a look?

139
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,040
Sure.

140
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,280
I'll go in later.

141
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,680
I'll check these first.

142
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:25,960
Ek.

143
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,560
Mm?

144
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,800
Please give this file to Inspector Ken.

145
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,320
Okay.

146
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,400
Thanks.

147
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:34,760
Ek.

148
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:37,160
I'll take it. I'm seeing him anyway.

149
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:37,920
