165
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,440
Inspector James.

166
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,760
Where are you going?

167
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,880
Stay for drinks tonight.

168
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,560
We'll call it your welcome party.

169
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,800
Tangme, you should come too.

170
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,240
Of course I wouldn't miss it.

171
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,120
All right.

172
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,480
A drink might be nice.

173
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,520
Right?

174
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:24,200
Exactly.

175
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,680
Mm.

176
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,640
Is this file for Inspector Ken?

177
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:28,240
Yes.

178
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,600
Then give it to Inspector James.

179
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,760
You'll see him later.

180
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,600
Why give it to me?

181
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:36,320
Aren't you two close?

182
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,240
Oh, right.

183
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:40,160
Invite Inspector Ken
to tonight's party too.

184
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:40,800
Good idea.

185
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:41,840
Don't worry.

186
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,840
- We'll help get him drunk.
- Yep.

187
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,600
I'll help too.

188
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,520
Right, Tangme?

189
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:46,120
Yeah, the more the merrier.

190
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,400
Invite him along.

191
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:52,320
I'll give the file to Inspector Ken.

192
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,800
As for inviting him to the bar,

193
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:55,960
I can't promise anything.

194
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,960
Fine.

195
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,000
Oh!

196
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:58,960
Phong.

197
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,960
- What?
- This morning...

198
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,600
I walked in and killed the mood.

199
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,600
What were they doing?

200
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,440
They were kissing.

201
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,200
No way.

202
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:07,280
We're at the police station.

203
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,280
Did you take a picture?

204
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,320
Officer Phong asked me
to give you this file.

205
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,400
It's a report from the district office.

206
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:33,800
Tee changed his name once.

207
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,840
You still won't drop the case, will you?

208
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,840
Then from now on,

209
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:52,080
