210
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,560
I may not be able to help.

211
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,680
Thanks for the warning.

212
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,000
Phong and the other officers

213
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,960
are throwing me a welcome party
at a bar tonight.

214
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,400
They asked me to invite you.

215
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,560
But don't worry.

216
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:13,080
I already declined for you
and said you wouldn't go.

217
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,520
(Tee's ID Information)

218
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:16,280
Come on! Welcome to
Nakhon Sawan's hottest bar!

219
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,920
Come on, man. Get over here.

220
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:21,120
Hey, pour me some.

221
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:25,480
There's plenty left.

222
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:28,600
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

223
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:31,600
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

224
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:36,640
Inspector, you're still here?

225
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,400
Didn't you go drinking with them?

226
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:43,080
I'm catching up on some paperwork.

227
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,560
It's all James's.

228
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,640
Inspector, look!

229
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:59,200
This is the hottest bar.

230
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,600
First time in Nakhon Sawan.

231
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,720
Checked in. Back to partying.

232
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,120
Keep drinking.

233
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,480
When are you coming?
We're almost wasted.

234
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:09,760
Why am I drinking here alone?

235
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:10,720
Tangme, hurry up.

236
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:12,160
I get it, though.

237
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,480
He probably needs to unwind.

238
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:18,240
It's been one problem after another
since he came to Nakhon Sawan.

239
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,520
I know

240
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:26,080
I shouldn't pry into your private life,

241
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:27,400
but...

242
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,880
