243
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:43,360
Deep down, don't you think
Inspector James is a good partner?

244
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:47,280
Here.

245
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,320
Didn't you want this?

246
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,040
Ever since

247
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,920
Inspector James came here,

248
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:56,240
the atmosphere at the station
has changed a lot.

249
00:17:57,120 --> 00:18:00,320
Everyone's more motivated

250
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:02,160
and takes their work more seriously.

251
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:05,520
We've made
real progress on the case, too.

252
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:10,360
With Inspector James always on the go,

253
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:13,760
even Phong has started working harder.

254
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:17,400
He used to work only for the paycheck.

255
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,280
But...

256
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,240
the person who's changed the most

257
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,600
is you, Inspector Ken.

258
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:28,480
Me?

259
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Before,

260
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:33,640
I only saw you a few times a year.

261
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,400
And honestly,

262
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,840
I was afraid to talk to you too.

263
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,800
But then I saw

264
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:42,440
Inspector James keep trying
to get closer to you.

265
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:45,680
That gradually gave me
the courage to approach you too.

266
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,280
It let me see another side of you.

267
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:53,640
I realized you're much kinder
and more approachable than you seem.

268
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,280
Even if

269
00:18:57,320 --> 00:19:00,840
people say you two
can't stand each other,

270
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,920
I don't see it that way.

271
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,880
To me, you two

272
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:09,000
work really well together.
You just won't admit it.

273
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:14,960
Seriously, people who don't get along
don't stick together all day.

274
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,040
And even though

275
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:20,560
Inspector James can be stubborn.
He acts tough sometimes,

276
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:24,160
and he's always risking his life
for the case.

277
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:24,760
Still,

278
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,840
he really is a great partner, right?

279
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:34,640
So...

280
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:38,040
don't be too hard on him, Inspector.

281
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,400
Or on yourself.

282
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:54,000
Phong keeps texting me to hurry over.

283
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:56,960
I'll get going.

